  "statuteText": "21-H:17 Department of Corrections; New Hampshire State Prison Fund Established. –\n\nThere is hereby established in the state treasury a state prison fund, which shall be administered by the department of corrections. The fund shall not lapse. The fund is established for the purpose of design and construction of a new New Hampshire state prison."
